  "after": {
    "title": "What Happens After You Graduate?",
    "rows": [
      {
        "title": "Build a Competitive Edge for Top AI Jobs",
        "html": "<p>Leverage Futurense’s global industry network from <strong>Fortune 500s to unicorns and startups.</strong><br/>Access exclusive, curated job opportunities tailored to your skills and aspirations across high-growth tech roles.<br/><br/><strong><em>T&amp;C:</em></strong><em> Futurense offers career support, not placement guarantees.</em></p>",
        "image": "A/68b7ca16e59586fdab781dc9_Build%20a%20Competitive%20Edge.avif",
        "alt": "Four young adults sitting around a table outdoors, using laptops and smiling during a discussion."
      },
      {
        "title": "Master’s from IIT Jodhpur",
        "html": "<p>Seamlessly transition into the <strong>M. Tech* in Data Engineering (Executive Mode) at IIT Jodhpur.</strong><br/>Get trained for leadership in the digital era through globally aligned curriculum and advanced technical depth. <br/><br/><strong>T&amp;C</strong>: Requires at least 60% in B.S Degree and 2 years of work experience for pursuing a Master’s Degree.<br/><br/><strong>*Condition Apply </strong>- Admission to M.Tech is subject to IIT Jodhpur’s approval</p>",
        "image": "A/68b7ca166e1356a0cfb6a253_Master%E2%80%99s%20from%20IIT%20Jodhpur.avif",
        "alt": "Entrance arch of the Indian Institute of Technology Jodhpur with palm trees and potted plants in front."
      },
      {
        "title": "Study Abroad After Your BS Degree",
        "html": "<p>Pursue a Master’s at over <strong>50+ top US universities</strong>, including <strong>DePaul, Rutgers, and Drexel</strong>. Choose from STEM-designated specializations and unlock a <strong>3-year OPT</strong> after completing your Master’s.</p>",
        "image": "A/68b7ca1650550728ab54e916_Study%20Abroad.avif",
        "alt": "Smiling young woman in denim jacket holding a passport with the Statue of Liberty and American flag in the background."
      },
      {
        "title": "Start Your Entrepreneurial Journey",
        "html": "<p>Launch your startup with the IIT credibility behind you. Get mentorship from IIT Jodhpur faculty, access to innovation ecosystems, and the support of a growing alumni network. Whether you’re building in AI, data-driven platforms, or tech-enabled services, this degree gives you a powerful launchpad.</p>",
        "image": "A/68b7ca1601f19d6922fe8806_Entrepreneurial%20Journey.avif",
        "alt": "Smiling businessman in glasses holding a clipboard and pen in a modern office."
      },
      {
        "title": "Prepare for UPSC, SSC & Government Exams with an IIT Advantage",
        "html": "<p>Prepare stress-free with a <strong>flexible format</strong> that lets you earn an IIT degree while you study. Gain an <strong>unmatched edge</strong> in interviews with AI skills and the IIT tag, especially for roles in policy, tech, and governance. Because let’s face it; <strong>IITians always stand out</strong></p>",
        "image": "A/68b7ca15779e54237825bb18_UPSC%2C%20SSC%20%26%20Government%20Exams.avif",
        "alt": "Smiling woman in an orange jacket studying at a desk with a laptop and open book, with logos of Indian government exam boards around her."
      }
    ]
  },
